msgid "ADR 0007：大爆炸替换旧 GUI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:4
#: 237f87dfd0304aa885b7175765cf2925
msgid "**状态**：已接受 **日期**：2026-08-04 **关联**：ADR 0006（e2m2e GUI 前端定位）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:8
#: 83ecfd443a1f4ffd8f43d3192a3645ca
msgid "背景"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:10
#: 8498321cccba4de1b6d975ba9c47a977
msgid ""
"现有 GUI（`tod/gui/`）基于 mixin 架构：`MainWindow` 继承 `FileTreeMixin` + "
"`JobPanelMixin` + `QMainWindow`。通过 QProcess 子进程运行脚本，文件浏览器手动刷新，参数面板从 "
"SCRIPT_ENTRY 自动生成。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:12
#: 2520ae6956114eb98142d255e8d83aea
msgid "新 GUI 需要根本不同的架构：Project 数据模型、内嵌可视化、Facade 直调。两种架构差异太大，增量改造不可行。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:14
#: 97bff62995ae43a2b7bf443c1801f970
msgid "决策"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:16
#: fe9aea6b98d94477bca4929a2a2643f7
msgid "**大爆炸替换**：用新的四层架构（model/engine/view/app）完全替代旧的 `tod/gui/`。不做并行双模式，不做原地重构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:18
#: f495706cda74443ab62e93de586139df
msgid "理由"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:20
#: b9b74b5305e74e1ba25435472739ea74
msgid "**架构差异不可调和**：旧 GUI 的核心假设是\"脚本 = 进程\"，新架构是\"API = 线程\"。这两个假设不兼容。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:21
#: 0f67b8ba072b4201854db56fb94460b4
msgid ""
"**mixin 限制**：`MainWindow` 的 mixin 链（FileTreeMixin → JobPanelMixin → "
"QMainWindow）使得替换任一组件都需要重构整条继承链。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:22
#: 68a2f2a7d39049f3b64010d5a501689e
msgid ""
"**SCRIPT_ENTRY 废弃**：旧 GUI 的参数面板生成依赖 SCRIPT_ENTRY 扫描，新 GUI 从 Pydantic "
"模型生成。机制完全不同。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:23
#: 7672787afbff4f57b47f9b06634427ad
msgid "**e2m2e_compat 不再需要**：新架构直接调用 e2m2e 的新 API 路径，不需要旧路径兼容层。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:25
#: 003a78d8564b47149a6cf2660a137e6c
msgid "后果"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:27
#: 844317d3a99b476a91fdd5c643683bae
msgid "正面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:29
#: bb2810783dbf4b3c858aadbfd0096f3c
msgid "无技术债务继承"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:30
#: b9ec589d143e4a9392dd19a74d238c17
msgid "新架构干净，无 mixin 复杂度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:31
